  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>RM_Veessa</defName>
    <label>veessa</label>
    <description>Nothing rots here, so something learned to eat what cannot rot. The veessa is a grain-scale plated miller that works the mummified fields, rasping the desiccated dead into a powder its gut chemistry can finally unlock. It is the only thing on the planet that digests the dry dead; everything else fights over the wet kill and leaves. It never touches the living or the fresh, because fresh is water, and water draws things it cannot afford to meet. Hunting one costs more water than it holds.</description>
    <statBases>
      <MoveSpeed>1.4</MoveSpeed>
      <MarketValue>5</MarketValue>
      <ComfyTemperatureMin>0</ComfyTemperatureMin>
      <ComfyTemperatureMax>90</ComfyTemperatureMax>
      <MeatAmount>1</MeatAmount>
      <LeatherAmount>0</LeatherAmount>
      <Wildness>0.95</Wildness>
    </statBases>
    <tools>
      <li>
        <label>rasp-mouth</label>
